line	<str>Talk to the Fossegrimen to enchant the sigil. (Found by summoning at the Strange altar south-west of Rellekka) .</str>
line	
line	<str>Head east of Rellekka to the Mountain Camp</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the path north of the Mountain Camp and inspect the Large Geyser. Use your pet rock on the Geyser.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Rellekka and talk to Peer the Seer found south-west of the Rellekka market.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the geyser and wear the ice gloves, if you forget you may re-equip them and try again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the large geyser to the west to get the polishing rock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use any of the components together while having a glassblowing pipe in the inventory to create V's shield.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Brundt south-east of Rellekka.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Longhall and talk to Brundt again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wield V's shield and fight the basilisks until you reach 100%. You have to hit a basilisk at least once to make its death count towards completion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel on the Fremennik Boat to the Island of Stone.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Brundt to explain the cave door puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Solve the cave door puzzle (Mastermind (board game)|Mastermind).</col>
step	30	-	Quick guide step 30
line	<str>Buy 2 kegs of beer from Thora in the Longhall before you start the quest to save time later. (bank them when you have the chance to reduce weight while running around)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Brundt in the Longhall to start the quest. or</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north and talk to Freygerd in the house south of the sandpit.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip your mirror shield (to avoid taking damage and stat drain), then search the sandpit (to the north) and kill the Basilisk Youngling (level 53).</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up the Unsealed letter and read it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the rockslide west of the house to get the Fang.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the boxes south of the house to get the Venom gland.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Freygerd to give her the items.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Brundt to receive a note, read it, then talk to him again for a cutscene. or</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-east of Rellekka, following the dirt path, and talk to Brundt. Go through all chat options to learn how to restore V's shield.</str>
line	
line	<str>Obtain a Fremennik shield (this is not the tradeable Neitiznot shield).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Baba Yaga on Lunar Isle to turn your molten glass into molten glass (i). or if using lunar spellbook and Ourania teleport is not unlocked.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north-east of the town to Lunar Isle mine and mine stalagmites for 3 lunar ore.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the mine and travel to the Astral Altar with 100 astral runes in your inventory and craft on the altar to obtain Lunar glass. Then return to Rellekka.</str>
line	
line	<str>Smelt 3 lunar bars in a furnace (Rellekka is convenient) or you can use Superheat Item.</str>
line	
line	<str>Smith the V sigil on an anvil (Rellekka is convenient).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Fossegrimen to enchant the sigil. (Found by summoning at the Strange altar south-west of Rellekka) .</str>
line	
line	<str>Head east of Rellekka to the Mountain Camp</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the path north of the Mountain Camp and inspect the Large Geyser. Use your pet rock on the Geyser.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Rellekka and talk to Peer the Seer found south-west of the Rellekka market.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the geyser and wear the ice gloves, if you forget you may re-equip them and try again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the large geyser to the west to get the polishing rock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use any of the components together while having a glassblowing pipe in the inventory to create V's shield.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Brundt south-east of Rellekka.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Longhall and talk to Brundt again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wield V's shield and fight the basilisks until you reach 100%. You have to hit a basilisk at least once to make its death count towards completion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel on the Fremennik Boat to the Island of Stone.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Brundt to explain the cave door puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Solve the cave door puzzle (Mastermind (board game)|Mastermind).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Equip V's shield and keep it equipped for the full fight.</col>
